note deep_agent.jc: a two-agent research team with memory that survives the run.
note Researcher remembers facts across runs. Writer calls researcher as a tool.
note The final brief streams out as it is written.
note Give it a real mind with: export JESUNCODE_AI_COMMAND="ollama run llama3.1"

to read_notes
    give back "Launch is Sep 30. Budget is 40k. Owner is Jesun."

to read_calendar
    give back "Sep 30 is a Wednesday. No conflicts on the calendar."

agent researcher
    persona is "You are Researcher, a careful fact finder. Answer in one short sentence."
    tools are [read_notes, read_calendar]
    remember is always
    steps are 6

agent writer
    persona is "You are Writer. Turn facts into a three line brief."
    tools are [researcher]
    steps are 8

show "Writing the brief (watch it stream):"
ask writer "write the launch brief" giving brief streaming
show "---"
show "The brief, saved in a variable:"
show brief

show "Asking researcher what it remembers:"
ask researcher "what launch facts do you remember?" giving recall
show recall
show "Run this again tomorrow: researcher still remembers, because its memory lives in ~/.jesun-code/memory."
